[ti:Neon Rain (Demo)]
[ar:Your Name]
[00:03.00]Street lights bleed into the rain
[00:07.20]I'm still humming your name
[00:11.00]Every drop a small goodbye
[00:15.40]Falling from a taller sky
[00:19.80]Maybe somewhere down this road
[00:24.00]The storm will lose its hold
[00:28.20]And I will learn to dance again
[00:32.60]Barefoot in the neon rain
